{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/322190/extras/def64e27bdf9e4e27b2ad4668489671b.poster.avif?t=1726132166\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/322190/extras/def64e27bdf9e4e27b2ad4668489671b.webm?t=1726132166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/322190/extras/def64e27bdf9e4e27b2ad4668489671b.mp4?t=1726132166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In <strong>SteamWorld Heist</strong>, you command a steam-driven pirate crew in a series of epic tactical shootouts. It\u2019s turn-based strategy with a twist: You manually aim the guns of your robots, allowing for insane skill shots and bullet-bouncing action!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/322190/extras/0f44c25545031cbfdbb25eee7931f106.avif?t=1726132166\" width=616 height=335 /></span><br><br>As the captain you will board, loot and shoot your way through enemy spaceships. Overcome the challenges of the vast frontier by upgrading your recruits with unique abilities, weapons \u2013 and even stylish hats!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/322190/extras/9fe9aaa3d1b6c10a19658b6d6c5b2c83.avif?t=1726132166\" width=616 height=78 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategy focused on skill rather than chance<br></li><li>Procedurally generated levels<br></li><li>15-20 hours of playtime, followed by New Game+<br></li><li>Kind to newcomers, deep and challenging for veterans<br></li><li>Soundtrack by Steam Powered Giraffe</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Grind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi